  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "It is a rainbow colored mountain, neither tall nor short. Its rocks give off green, red, yellow, blue, and white lights. There are no trees on it, but many kinds of grass in ten colors shine together more brightly than a sea of flowers. Fang Yuan names the pairing Five Light Mountain, ten colored grass, resources light path Gu Immortals often cultivate. The special environment produces large numbers of light path mortal Gu. Liu Qing Yu heavily developed the mountain, and it is quite big.",
      "chapters": [
        1152
      ],
