    },
    {
      "text": "Ying Wu Xie lacks a method to move it after selling pulling mountain Immortal Gu, so the mountain remains in Qing Yu blessed land for Fang Yuan to take. Fang Yuan uses pulling mountain Immortal Gu and moves Five Light Mountain into Mini Southern Border in his sovereign immortal aperture. There it becomes the biggest mountain, outmatching the mountains from Hei Fan grotto-heaven and leaving Immortal Succession Mountain second.",
      "chapters": [
        1152
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
